# Floor 1, the Broken Hall: kill the skeleton in two swings (02 §2.2 gives it 2 HP).
#
# The player starts two tiles below it and walks up, which also turns them to face it. The
# first hit knocks it back out of reach (01 §4.2), so the second swing needs a step forward
# first. It dies on tick 40 and finishes fading 12 ticks later (02 §2.1).

floor f1
room R2
at 6,6

assert room=R2 enemies=1 hp=6 treasure=0

U 10                     # close the gap, facing up
A                        # first swing
W 16                     # let it run, and the hit-stop with it
U 6                      # step back into reach after the knockback
A                        # second swing
W 16
assert enemies=1         # dead, but still fading

W 2
assert enemies=0 hp=6 treasure=1 deaths=0
